		{
			description: [
				"&l·&fis a GregTech integration package focusing on leisure, which is less difficult than other GrayTech packages."
				""
				"&l·&fMain processes"
				"&l·&7Steam&8ULV &r: Collect basic resources, larger and more powerful steam machines, steel making, ultra-dimensional earth forge"
				"&l·&7Low voltage&7LV &r: Basic electric equipment, electric blast furnace"
				"&l·&7medium voltage&bMV &r: silicon crystal, oil processing, upgraded machine"
				"&l·&7High Voltage&6HV &r: Processor, large chemical reactor, first-stage rocket to the moon, distillation tower, titanium"
				"&l·&7Ultra-high voltage&5EV &r: Nanoprocessor, void mining machine, second, third and fourth stage rocket, tungsten, platinum series metals"
				"&l·&7Strong pressure guide&9IV &r: quantum processor, alloy smelting furnace, fission reactor, fifth-stage rocket, large machine, assembly line, database"
				"&l·&7drama differential pressure&dLuV &r: crystal processor, silica, sixth-stage rocket, nuclear fusion MK1, computer"
				"&l·&7Zero point pressure&cZPM &r: wetware processor, nuclear fusion MK2, seventh-stage rocket"
				"&l·&7Ultimate Pressure&3UV &r: Bioactive Processor, Nuclear Fusion MK3, Deep Chemical Twister, Circuit Assembly Line, Space Elevator"
				"&l·&7Ultra High Voltage&4UHV &r: Optical Processor, Nuclear Fusion MK4, Stellar Flame Forge, Super Silica Bomb, Super Reactor"
				"&l·&7Extreme Overpressure&aUEV &r: Strange Processor, Fusion MK5, Supercritical Synthesis, Bedrock Processing, Adamantite"
				"&l·&7Extreme Pressure&2UIV &r: Universal Processor, Universe Detection, Mass Generator, Quarks, Superheavy Elements"
				"&l·&7Extreme Pressure&eUXV &r: Super Causal Processor, Dragon, Cosmic Neutron, Endless, Ultra-Dimensional Plasma Forge, Lado X"
				"&l·&7Overload Voltage&1OpV &r: Hyper-space-time circuit, universe simulation, time and space, singularity, eternity"
				"&l·&7Upper limit pressure&cMAX &r: Create item synthesis"
				"&l·&7Additional questions&cM&r&aA&r&9"
			]
