			description: [
				"&l·&fHandheld terminal&6Sneak right-click multi-block host&fcan automatically build a multi-block structure,&dempty-handed&fwill display a preview"
				"&l·&fTerminal recognizes the block in&bnot in the accessory slot &f's exquisite backpack"
				""
				"&l·&fThere are a few problems with automatic construction. It is recommended to put only the structure blocks in the backpack first, and then manually place the functional warehouse after building the main body."
				"&l·&fThe warehouse-less mode is very useful, but you need to right-click and open the GUI every time you enter the archive before it will take effect."
				""
				"&l·&fThe number of repeated structures is suitable for multi-block structures that can be stacked in multiple layers, such as distillation towers. The larger the value, the longer the structure."
				"&l·&fBased on the advanced terminal,&bis supported to replace the&fcoil, space elevator power module, component assembly line shell and stellar thermal container (click the \"level box\" text to open the selection interface)"
				""
				"&l·&fsupports&bmirror placement&fmulti-block structure, no warehouse mode continues to take effect"
				"&l·&fDemolition mode requires dismantling and closing once. You don’t want to explode all the samples, right?"
