		{
			description: [
				"&6&l\"The choice for departure\""
				""
				"&5▌ Foreword:"
				"&fTraveler, welcome to the world of GregTech."
				"&fAt this moment, a pill will determine the rules of this world and your starting point."
				""
				"&5▌&dPurple Pill · Path of the Successor"
				"&fChoose it and you will return as an experienced multi-game traveler."
				"&fThe experience of the past life is turned into a guide, and the auxiliary optical brain will provide you with a lot of help."
				"&fThe laws of this world are more tolerant to you and are suitable for you to explore new mysteries calmly."
				"&7Becoming a god or a false god? It's up to you - and at your expense."
				""
				"&5▌&eYellow Pill · Pioneer Journey"
				"&fChoose it and you will step into this world as a pure new student."
				"&f\"Pan-Galaxy Gray Technology Co., Ltd.\" will be your solid backing."
				"&fRich initial supplies are ready, inviting you to immerse yourself in the deep challenge of starting from scratch."
				"&fThis route does not include the path to becoming a god and remains original."
				""
				"&6&l※ Final tips:"
				"&eThis is a choice that shapes your destiny."
				"&ePlease follow your heart."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:annihilation_constrainer"
			id: "338B78A9B370B1C1"
			tasks: [{
				id: "375B37A687ADE758"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "choice of fate"
			x: -2.0d
			y: -9.0d
		}
