				"&f- Added a large number of KJS scripts and adjusted the ways to obtain a large number of items."
				"&f- Restructured part of the quest line and added several additional chapters."
				"&c- Tip: This version is not recommended for players who are new to GregTech: Leisure."
				"&f- If you want the original experience, please go to the \"GregTech: Leisure\" official group to get the original integration package."
				""
